  "affiliationText": "Information Science is offered as a B.S. through CALS (the same major core and elective options as the A&S B.A.; the colleges differ only in their own distribution/foundational requirements). Internal transfer is by application to the Department of Information Science. All courses in the major must be taken for a letter grade, with a grade of C- or higher; cumulative GPA of 2.3 or higher. A single course may not count toward more than one requirement within the major. Minimum 50 credits within the major and 120 credits overall for the degree.",
